{
  "description": "RFC 8785 (JSON Canonicalization Scheme) vectors for the command signing input. 'input' is any JSON value, kept as written here (key order and number spelling are preserved; regeneration re-indents the whitespace); 'expected' is its canonical form as a string. Regenerate 'expected' with: go test ./internal/contract -run TestCanonicalizeVectorsFile -update. The first two cases are the worked examples from RFC 8785 itself, except that the supplementary plane key uses U+1D11E instead of the RFC's emoji.",
